MesenCE: MesenCE (Multi-system emulator)
MesenCE:
MesenCE: Mesen is a multi-system emulator for Windows, Linux, and macOS. It
MesenCE: supports NES, SNES, Game Boy (GB/SGB/GBC), Game Boy Advance,
MesenCE: PC Engine, SMS/Game Gear, and WonderSwan (WS/WSC).
MesenCE:
MesenCE: MesenCE is a community-managed fork based on Mesen2, created to
MesenCE: maintain and expand this emulator into the future.
